Changes made by this add-on, on the user's computer: the downloaded weights
are decoded and the encoder's matrices are quantized to 8-bit integers, one
scale per output channel, for ONNX Runtime. The encoder graph in
bark3_addon/graph/ was exported from transformers' ParakeetForTDT
(Apache-2.0) and holds no weights.
